{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26568","headline":"送河中杨少府宴崔驸马宅 · 姚合","name":"送河中杨少府宴崔驸马宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤凰楼下醉醺醺，晚出东门蝉渐闻。\n不使乡人治驿路，却将家累宿山云。\n闲时采药随僧去，每月请钱共客分。\n县吏若非三载满，自知无计更寻君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}